      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TUKO (4) struggled in tougher grade last start after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (17.38) beating Come On Cardiff in a Maiden on October 28. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Has ability and is a key runner. CLOVER PUCA (7) broke through for his maiden success last time out at this track over 300m (17.55). Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. TRALEE VIXEN (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (18.06) in a Grade 5 at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Cannot be taken lightly. KNIGHT'S KAOS (5) is a last start winner worth following up.",
